      "updated": 1779486564292,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A Mumbai tiffin delivery service needs to track orders as they move\nthrough stages — from kitchen preparation to final delivery. Delivery\nstaff update the status at each checkpoint.",
      "fontSize": 34.04935524749735,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "F5hXThrZrbJUwZ22h6oYz",
      "originalText": "A Mumbai tiffin delivery service needs to track orders as they move through stages — from kitchen preparation to final delivery. Delivery staff update the status at each checkpoint.",
