      "text": "Delhi University students need a platform to buy and sell used\ntextbooks. Sellers list their books with a price, and buyers browse\nor search. When a book is purchased, the seller marks it as sold.",
      "fontSize": 34.04935524749735,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "arYx9YVHLvrzbiCuWhJax",
      "originalText": "Delhi University students need a platform to buy and sell used textbooks. Sellers list their books with a price, and buyers browse or search. When a book is purchased, the seller marks it as sold.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
